        "question": "When should I use plan mode?",
        "answer": "Use it for unfamiliar, risky, or multi-file changes. Skip it when a small change has obvious scope."
      },
      {
        "question": "How should I verify generated code?",
        "answer": "Provide tests, builds, linters, screenshots, or comparison scripts that produce observable pass or fail evidence."
